  {"h": "Raised-rail towers on flush rails", "body": "The Palisade's rails have no gap underneath. Towers made to wrap a raised rail won't clamp securely."},
  {"h": "Assuming 220 lb on every bar", "body": "Hyundai's spec sheets print 220 lb for the roof rails, and owners quote the same figure from Hyundai's accessory crossbar guide. Thule's Palisade system is rated at 165 lb. The lowest number applies."},
